# Custody and physical holding establish protection duties, not shelter or speech actuality.
# ── Chapter 25 fidelity pins: "A Prisoner Is a Person" ────────────────────────
#
# KIND: CONTENT pin. Run:
#   ./verify.sh --only book-1/25-a-prisoner-is-a-person.pins.nibli
#   ./verify.sh          # all substantive pins and contradiction checks
#
# Zed is introduced BY this pin file rather than living in the constitution:
# the chapter needs someone the person-roster has never mentioned, and every
# prisoner in the cast is also asserted as a person. Zed's sparse record
# "isolates one rule": custody is the only root of standing it holds.

# WHAT FALSE MEANS HERE — three kinds, and only one is a verdict. A FALSE on a
# corpus name this KB never mentions is real but empty: nothing could have made
# it TRUE. A non-corpus name is not a FALSE at all — the run aborts, pins not
# trustworthy. And a well-formed query on an argument its relation never
# carries is a vacuous green that passes forever. Article 0a closed the
# ASSERTION side only — a widening fact aborts the run rather than loading —
# but a QUERY on an unmentioned name still answers a clean FALSE, so kind one
# is untouched. Pin a FALSE only where the KB could have said TRUE, and say in
# the comment what would flip it.

:expect-pins 39

# "Zed is convicted in a named case of injuring Ivo." These entries give the
# custody authorisation in force: "independent witnesses agree on the person,
# the court, the judgment, the injury, the source and the review period".
injure(Zed, Ivo).
judge(Court, Zed).
cite(Court, Case_Zed, Zed).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Zed, CaseScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Zed, CaseScope).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Court, HolderScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Court, HolderScope).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, CourtJudgment, JudgmentScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, CourtJudgment, JudgmentScope).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Ivo, InjuryVictimScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Ivo, InjuryVictimScope).
authorized(Case_Zed, ActiveCustody, Case_Zed).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, ActiveCustody, PowerScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, ActiveCustody, PowerScope).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Case_Zed, CaseBindingScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Case_Zed, CaseBindingScope).
limit(Case_Zed, Case_Zed, Window_Custody).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Window_Custody, LimitScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Window_Custody, LimitScope).
continue(Case_Zed, Epoch_Current).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Epoch_Current, RenewalScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Epoch_Current, RenewalScope).
endorses(Electorate, Case_Zed).
endorses(TemporalReview, Case_Zed).


# The rest of the case custody needs: "criminal proof of the injury,
# adjudicated defences, disclosed evidence, counsel, a fair hearing and an
# individually justified sentence", reviewed harm findings, "a reviewed
# placement in a named supported residence" and challenge intake.
list(Case_Zed, Zed, Incident_Case_Zed, CustodyMatter).
list(Case_Zed, PublicInjuryOffence, Evidence_Case_Zed, CustodyOffenceEvidence).
list(Case_Zed, Ivo, Prosecution, CustodyParties).
list(Case_Zed, Court, CustodyMeritsReview, CustodyDecisionActors).
judge(Court, Case_Zed).
judge(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed).
authorized(Court, CustodyTrialAdjudicator, Case_Zed).
authorized(CustodyMeritsReview, IndependentCustodyMeritsReviewer, Case_Zed).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, Zed, CustodySubjectScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, Zed, CustodySubjectScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, Incident_Case_Zed, CustodyIncidentScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, Incident_Case_Zed, CustodyIncidentScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, PublicInjuryOffence, CustodyOffenceScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, PublicInjuryOffence, CustodyOffenceScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, Evidence_Case_Zed, CustodyEvidenceScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, Evidence_Case_Zed, CustodyEvidenceScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, Ivo, CustodyVictimScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, Ivo, CustodyVictimScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, Prosecution, CustodyProsecutorScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, Prosecution, CustodyProsecutorScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, PublicLawInForceBeforeTheAct, CustodyPriorLawScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, PublicLawInForceBeforeTheAct, CustodyPriorLawScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, IdentityActCausationAndRequiredMentalElementProvedBeyondReasonableDoubt, CustodyProofScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, IdentityActCausationAndRequiredMentalElementProvedBeyondReasonableDoubt, CustodyProofScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, NoPunishmentForStatusOrProtectedConduct, CustodyConductScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, NoPunishmentForStatusOrProtectedConduct, CustodyConductScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, AdmissibleDisclosedEvidenceNoCoercionOrDecisiveSecretEvidence, CustodyAdmissibilityScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, AdmissibleDisclosedEvidenceNoCoercionOrDecisiveSecretEvidence, CustodyAdmissibilityScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, NoticeCounselAccessibleHearingAndPublicReasons, CustodyProcedureScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, NoticeCounselAccessibleHearingAndPublicReasons, CustodyProcedureScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, IndependentlyAdjudicatedDefencesAndExculpatoryEvidence, CustodyDefencesScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, IndependentlyAdjudicatedDefencesAndExculpatoryEvidence, CustodyDefencesScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, IndividualNecessaryProportionateLeastRestrictiveCustodialSentence, CustodySentenceScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, IndividualNecessaryProportionateLeastRestrictiveCustodialSentence, CustodySentenceScope).
observe(Court, Case_Zed, NoDoubleJeopardyOrUnexpiredBar, CustodyFinalityScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Case_Zed, NoDoubleJeopardyOrUnexpiredBar, CustodyFinalityScope).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, Court, CustodyTrialActorEligibleAtDecisionScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, Court, CustodyTrialActorEligibleAtDecisionScope).
observe(Chronicle, Case_Zed, CustodyMeritsReview, CustodyMeritsReviewerEligibleAtDecisionScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Case_Zed, CustodyMeritsReview, CustodyMeritsReviewerEligibleAtDecisionScope).
list(Merits_Order_Case_Zed, Case_Zed, Epoch_Current, RecordSequence).
observe(Chronicle, Merits_Order_Case_Zed, Case_Zed, RecordStartScope).
observe(Chronicle, Merits_Order_Case_Zed, Epoch_Current, RecordEndScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Merits_Order_Case_Zed, Case_Zed, RecordStartScope).
observe(TemporalReview, Merits_Order_Case_Zed, Epoch_Current, RecordEndScope).
list(Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Zed, Case_Zed, CustodySeverityFinding).
list(Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, InjuryToPerson, Evidence_Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, CustodySeverityDimensionEvidence).
list(Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Ivo, Incident_Case_Zed, CustodySeverityVictimIncident).
authorized(Court, CustodySeverityAdjudicator, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo).
authorized(CustodyMeritsReview, IndependentSeverityReviewer, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Case_Zed, SeverityCaseScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Case_Zed, SeverityCaseScope).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Zed, SeveritySubjectScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Zed, SeveritySubjectScope).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Incident_Case_Zed, SeverityIncidentScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Incident_Case_Zed, SeverityIncidentScope).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Ivo, SeverityVictimScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Ivo, SeverityVictimScope).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, InjuryToPerson, SeverityDimensionScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, InjuryToPerson, SeverityDimensionScope).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Evidence_Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, SeverityEvidenceScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, Evidence_Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, SeverityEvidenceScope).
observe(Court, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, AdjudicatedHarmAndMentalElementWithNoticeCounselChallengeAndReasons, SeverityProcedureScope).
observe(CustodyMeritsReview, Severity_Zed_InjuryToPerson_Ivo, AdjudicatedHarmAndMentalElementWithNoticeCounselChallengeAndReasons, SeverityProcedureScope).
list(Placement_Case_Zed, Zed, Case_Zed, CustodyPlacement).
list(Placement_Case_Zed, Place_Zed, SupportedResidence, CustodyPlaceKind).
list(Placement_Case_Zed, Case_Zed, Window_Custody, CustodyPlacementPeriod).
authorized(State, CustodyPlacementAuthority, Placement_Case_Zed).
authorized(PlacementReview, IndependentPlacementReviewer, Placement_Case_Zed).
observe(State, Placement_Case_Zed, Zed, CustodyPlacementSubjectScope).
observe(PlacementReview, Placement_Case_Zed, Zed, CustodyPlacementSubjectScope).
observe(State, Placement_Case_Zed, Case_Zed, CustodyPlacementCaseScope).
observe(PlacementReview, Placement_Case_Zed, Case_Zed, CustodyPlacementCaseScope).
observe(State, Placement_Case_Zed, Place_Zed, CustodyPlacementPlaceScope).
observe(PlacementReview, Placement_Case_Zed, Place_Zed, CustodyPlacementPlaceScope).
observe(State, Placement_Case_Zed, SupportedResidence, CustodyPlacementKindScope).
observe(PlacementReview, Placement_Case_Zed, SupportedResidence, CustodyPlacementKindScope).
